+        // The boss materials of Data/Item/ItemDrop.txt: nine rows which each tie one material to
+        // one boss of this map, all with DropRate 1000. The package's DropRate scale is read as
+        // parts per million (the only reading which matches an anchor present in both sources: the
+        // Dark Horse and Dark Raven spirits are 1000 there and 0.001 in Pets.cs), so 1000 -> 0.1 %.
+        // Measured before applying: the chance sum of a monster of this map stays at 0.8701, below
